sequenceDiagram
  participant Sensor
  participant ESP32
  participant MQTT as MQTT Broker
  participant API as Express API
  participant DB as MongoDB
  participant UI as React Dashboard
  Sensor->>ESP32: Analog readings
  ESP32->>MQTT: Publish telemetry over WiFi
  MQTT->>API: Deliver message
  API->>DB: Store logs and state
  UI->>API: Request dashboard data
  API->>DB: Query / aggregate
  DB-->>API: Results
  API-->>UI: JSON response
